# omarchy-container-gapps accounts: one Google account per line.
#
#   <label>  <apps>  [email]  [color]
#
# label  Name on the pill. One Firefox container per label; renaming a label
#        makes a new, signed-out container.
# apps   mail, cal, or mail,cal
# email  Optional. Pre-fills Google's sign-in page.
# color  Optional. An Omarchy theme color (accent, red, green, yellow, blue,
#        magenta, cyan, orange) or #rrggbb. Defaults cycle through the theme.
#
# Changes show up in open windows within a couple of seconds.

# Personal   mail,cal   you@example.com
# Work       mail,cal   you@example.org
